program	errors/with_var_ref_invalidation.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	differs
expect	error
build	refused	exclusive access violation: `v` is passed as `&var` while also being accessed in the same call
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: exclusive access violation: `v` is passed as `&var` while also being accessed in the same call"
log	"  --> examples/errors/with_var_ref_invalidation.saw:16:5"
log	"     |"
log	" 16 |     v.with_var_ref<Void>(0, { [&var v] e in try! v.push(9) })"
log	"     |     ^"
log	"   hint: disjoint access paths are allowed (e.g. `&var p.x` with `&p.y`); give the mutable reference exclusive access"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
